# Policy for multi-db sync between local llm-gateway-pg and 252's pg17 docker.
# Each db_name declares its sync mode:
#   structure-only    sync DDL only, skip all data (e.g. llm_gateway)
#   structure+data    sync DDL and ordinary-table data
# Hot/partitioned tables (pg_class.relkind='p' or relispartition) are
# ALWAYS structure-only regardless of db.mode — this is a global rule
# applied by the orchestrator. data mode only applies to ordinary tables
# (pg_class.relkind='r') that are not partitions.
#
# Conflict resolution: when 252 and local disagree, LOCAL wins for
# structure; for data, local is treated as the source of truth and is
# pushed to 252 (row-level: INSERT/UPSERT/DELETE as appropriate).

llm_gateway = structure-only

# Add other product databases here as they appear on 252's pg17.
# Each line: <db_name> = <mode>
# Example:
#   memora       = structure+data
#   agent_companion = structure-only
